, "nsfw": false, "body": "初めまして。\nブラックドラゴンのデビルンのお腹が風船のように膨らんだ姿を描いて欲しい。細かい構図等はお任せします。\n\nお手数ですが、宜しくお願いします。\n\n参考資料\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1lIqliMxlO0jZ0LO6XUmzujgF3_6NG5bW", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Huang_Long_/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/a6da37c7/uploads/origins/ab8dde92-3634-4f08-a15f-e5fa26dde01c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02f6e81e01e3b8311f3c143c35bf093d", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/a6da37c7/uploads/origins/ab8dde92-3634-4f08-a15f-e5fa26dde01c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=02f6e81e01e3b8311f3c143c35bf093d, https://si.imgix.net/a6da37c7/uploads/origins/ab8dde92-3634-4f08-a15f-e5fa26dde01c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=26035f9c4b939de625b6643eb1b75076 2x, https://si.imgix.net/a6da37c7/uploads/origins/ab8dde92-3634-4f08-a15f-e5fa26dde01c?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2080154f7c610521e1418645cee72915 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Nice to meet you, I am Nekonokomi,\nI am active as a Vtuber,\nI found your drawings very attractive.\nCould you draw my illustration in your style?\n\nhttps://twitter.com/nekono_komithi?t=mlwybFxAw7oWdOiBDShwIg&s=09", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@Huang_Long_/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/1e61527e/uploads/origins/e917dcc3-b8d8-4172-9cd3-7efde66b3fc8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9104537b995f320e3903c5b38f27fd82", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1e61527e/uploads/origins/e917dcc3-b8d8-4172-9cd3-7efde66b3fc8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=9104537b995f320e3903c5b38f27fd82, https://si.imgix.net/1e61527e/uploads/origins/e917dcc3-b8d8-4172-9cd3-7efde66b3fc8?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=25d1a